ob_data (["long":"@@query_long","short.text":"巫師留言板","short":"@@query_short","name":"board","c_cap_name":"留言板","long.text":"這是一個留言板，專供人留言紀事。詳細用法請參看 help board。這個留言板雖然是屬於巫師公會的，但任何人都歡迎在這裡留言。","id":({"board","bulletin board",}),"c_name":"留言板","silent_look":1,])
messages ({(["locked":"elon","id":55,"body":"    五月二十日會議記錄    出席人員: Annihilator , Elon , Ruby , Iris , Aquarius ,              Ega , Redheart , Indra    討論提綱       1 . 更換 driver : 前一次更換driver 後crash 三次, 原因均為                         griffon , 推測是mount.c 有問題, 改寫                         mount.c 後更換driver.         2 . 武器等級 : 武器等級原本的建議表似乎並不受重視 . 有提案                      建議改行ES2 的weapon type 方式, 但因物品太多                      故無結果 .        3 . 由於記憶體接近飽和 , 故將來有新區域出現時, 將逐步關閉           部份舊區域 , 並修正 ES 之風格 .       4 . heart_beat() 改寫.以減低 cpu load       5 . 對於玩家指令 \"do\" 加以限制, 每個 heart heat 限為五個.           且scan 方式由 explode 改為 sscanf       6 . body 由object 改寫後置入 daemon .       7 . 檔案流出 : 據信其它MUD 有相當多的file 來自ES , 因為無法防範                      故請欲\"交流\"者先行知會一聲, 以免發生誤會。並請各                      位在寫檔案時記得於檔頭處簽上智慧財產權聲明.                      如 : // This file contains all gamble funcs                           //   By Indra@Eastern_Story  5.20.95       8 . 鑑於巫師日漸增多, 而產能並未跟著提高 , 故見習巫師升為正式巫師           後一段時間(一至三個月)若無作品, 將酌情予以暫時調降回見習巫師.       9 . 更換driver 後改寫lib , 整理 daemons .                                                        記錄 Indra.","title":"會議記錄","time":801083538,"poster":"Indra",]),(["id":66,"body":"On Tue May 23, Aquarius wrote:> 	記得以前有人拼命吃藥, 吃到後來生病了再吃再吃就會有 bug.> 	好像這問題並沒有解決.> 	另外 strong pill 會把 player 的身體狀況設成良好, 而 > 	conditions 卻仍然有 \"生病\",(因為他生病後才吃 strong pill)> 	請檢查.strong pill 是指healer做的養生主嗎?如果是, 那本來就不是治病的,是用來治療 weak(虛弱) 症狀用......請勿亂服成藥:p                      Iris","title":"Re: 關於藥的bug","time":801248749,"poster":"Iris",]),(["id":67,"title":"new objects ... save memory version","body":"Hi ! All friends :    Annihilator provide us a good method to save objects'mapping ( to save memory ) .    Now I use it on basic objects ( items, weapons and armor .... )    Seems can't use on living objects .. Hmm... don't know why ..    have modified /std/object/prop.c ... just a slightly modify    and have 2 samples : /object/torch.c & bandage.c , You can compare with their old version	torch.old and bandage.old ... just a small difference.    the benefit is ... memory need : a torch -> 700 bytes to 26x bytes ..	I think ... no more bugs on it loh :P)    PS. I am still consider about simplify the modify process ..	because the objects of ES are too many .. 	so .. please don't modify your files now ..						RubyPS. Test on /obj/bag.c again ... save 350 bytes ..","time":801258232,"poster":"Ruby",]),(["id":68,"title":"turn off ansi color in shout","body":"Hi ! Dear Wizards :    I have closed the color ansi code while players shout.    If you have any suggest ! please let me know !! thanks !!						Ruby","time":801258678,"poster":"Ruby",]),(["id":69,"body":"        Found 2 Multi-Loginer        apolo-polo 140.115.123.234        gim-alis 140.113.204.22          the former can sure..the later not sure..","title":"Multi-Loginer","time":801268393,"poster":"Innocence",]),(["id":70,"title":"Re: Multi-Loginer","body":"On Wed May 24, Innocence wrote:>         Found 2 Multi-Loginer>         apolo-polo 140.115.123.234>         gim-alis 140.113.204.22>           the former can sure..the later not sure..能不能說清楚一點, 例如你snoop多久, 有沒有找來問話上來的address 是pc or 工作站,  這一類的證據, 要 nuke 才有依據                         Iris.","time":801281922,"poster":"Iris",]),(["id":71,"body":"On Tue May 23, Aquarius wrote:> 	記得以前有人拼命吃藥, 吃到後來生病了再吃再吃就會有 bug.> 	好像這問題並沒有解決.> 	另外 strong pill 會把 player 的身體狀況設成良好, 而 > 	conditions 卻仍然有 \"生病\",(因為他生病後才吃 strong pill)> 	請檢查.藥吃太多的bug\"好像\"解決了...磕藥磕的頭好痛:~                Iris","title":"Re: 關於藥的bug","time":801298775,"poster":"Iris",]),(["id":72,"title":"小bug?","body":"如果自己所在的這間房間是黑暗的...那麼就不能看隔壁的房間...這是bug嗎? 還是本來的設定就要如此?","time":801405521,"poster":"Stasia",]),(["id":73,"title":"也是bug...","body":"to aquarius:    thief公會那隻叫什麼taylers(不知有沒拚錯) 可以一直ask him about diploma..雖然diploma價值0元...但toss還是會有1silver.....所以如果有人set alias來賺錢的話.....*grin* 商店又很近說....:P建議改成一個人一次login只能要一張...: